            "label": "The disk never fills",
            "sections": [
              {
                "heading": "The disk never fills",
                "accent": "amber",
                "text": [
                  "Flow 3 — storage rotation with protected events."
                ],
                "bullets": [
                  "**Vaultd** appends recording segments per camera until disk fill crosses the `92%` high-water mark.",
                  "**Vaultd**'s rotation pass walks the segment index oldest-first.",
                  "Unprotected segments are unlinked until fill drops to the `85%` low-water mark.",
                  "*Protected events* — user-starred clips and alarm-tagged incidents — are skipped and survive overwrite regardless of age.",
                  "If the protected share exceeds its `25%` cap, **Vaultd** stops auto-protecting new incidents and flags the app for review.",
                  "**Vaultd** writes a rotation rollbook entry: bytes freed, oldest surviving day, protected count.",
                  "The app's storage page reads the rollbook: \"62 days on disk · oldest May 3 · 214 protected.\""
                ],
